Cell["\<\
the difference between old and new function is that it breaks apart \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]-((1+2 n) Log[X1+X2-2 Y])\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. If \
not so, the union will not recognize it as \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]-Log[X1+X2-2 Y],-2 n Log[X1+X2-2 Y]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\
\>", "Text",
